 {"i":"rg725c","o":"<div class=\"cs-li cs-bul\" style=\"margin-left:0px\">","h":"<span class=\"cs-fact-tag\">[<span class=\"cs-hl\">계약금이 </span><span class=\"cs-hl\"><strong>해약금·손배예정 겸유</strong></span><span class=\"cs-hl\">면 §398② 감액 주장+§565① 해약금 해제 동시 O]</span></span>","k":"t1depw"},
